    <string name="device_setup_title">Keep Haven running</string>
    <string name="device_setup_body">Samsung / One UI aggressively stops background apps. For reliable monitoring:\n\n1. Battery optimisation: exempt Haven (%1$s).\n2. Open App info → Battery → set to \"Unrestricted\".\n3. App info → disable \"Pause app activity if unused\".\n4. App info → Permissions → turn off \"Remove permissions if app is unused\".\n5. Settings → Battery → Background usage limits → make sure Haven is NOT in \"Sleeping\" or \"Deep sleeping apps\".\n6. Leave the phone plugged in for long deployments.</string>
